  m_text: "New city, new people, new gigs, \na fresh new start to your life. \nYou're
    not from around here, \nonly arriving recently in the city, \nand still adjusting
    to its many quirks and niches. \nPretty soon you find yourself running low on
    cash, \nthe price of living in the city's ecosystem \na little higher than you
    expected. \nAfter a couple dead ends, \nyou finally find a gig offering \na big
    enough score to sate your needs, \nand after a few preparations, \nhead out to
    make a name for yourself."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fdc7906da3973c4aafa98f9cfe909cc, type: 2}
